          <h1>About Me</h1>
          <p>What makes a &ldquo;good&rdquo; life? How do other people see this, and what fits for me? These questions have occupied me for as long as I can remember. Others followed:</p>
          <div class="um-questions">
            <span>How does understanding succeed, so that we truly understand each other?</span>
            <span>What sustains a relationship and makes it satisfying?</span>
            <span>How can I be in good contact with myself and with others?</span>
            <span>What helps when life gets difficult or a conflict arises?</span>
            <span>How do we keep growing as people?</span>
          </div>
          <p>For me, these questions have always belonged as much to private life as to professional life.</p>
          <p>This initially purely personal interest has since become the core of my professional activities. It fills me with joy and awe to accompany people when something changes in their professional or private life and they want to develop further.</p><button class="rd-readmore" type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span class="faq-toggle"></span><span class="rd-readmore-t">Read more</span></button>
